1
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:13,240
Doctor,

2
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:14,400
how is he?

3
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:16,680
It's been eight hours. How is it?

4
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,920
The surgery wasn't successful.

5
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,520
Dad passed away.

6
00:01:25,720 --> 00:01:27,250
My condolences, everyone.

7
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:30,160
Now, I need to announce
an official matter.

8
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,560
Mr. He

9
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,720
left a will.

10
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:33,640
I will now

11
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,039
formally read it.

12
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,840
The 60% shares

13
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:41,320
of He Group,

14
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,160
the He Manor,

15
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:43,920
and all real estate,

16
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,600
safes,

17
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:45,800
and valuables in Rongcheng

18
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,960
will all be inherited by Li Zhangxin.

19
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,360
That is all.

20
00:01:56,039 --> 00:01:57,880
Dad gave me all his love.

21
00:01:58,840 --> 00:01:59,720
It turns out

22
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,980
Dad supported us being together.

23
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,220
I didn't expect it.

24
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,410
He opposed us so much back then,

25
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:08,000
yet he gave all his property to you.

26
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,440
By the way, Ms. Shu.

27
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,280
About the huge insurance policy

28
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,600
you bought for your husband

29
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,960
and Mrs. He...

30
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:18,040
Due to your husband's accident,

31
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,760
it has now officially taken effect.

32
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:20,720
But

33
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,380
Mrs. He is currently missing.

34
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,520
So for now...

35
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,560
We will find her.

36
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,560
Zhang Xin,

37
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,520
I finally get to see your downfall.

38
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,400
How did you know?

39
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,800
His shoes were covered in mud
when he came back that day.

40
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,860
I knew he went to the orphanage again.

41
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:48,460
Ever since the orphanage was abandoned,

42
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:50,680
He Shi often comes back here.

43
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,200
He's a neat freak.

44
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,860
If he hadn't come here,

45
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,400
he wouldn't have mud

46
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,560
on his shoes.

47
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:58,940
Besides Zhang Xin and the butler,

48
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:01,170
why is there another skeleton?

49
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:12,760
It should be the director's.

50
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,200
I thought

51
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,880
he came back here out of nostalgia.

52
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,399
Now it seems

53
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,760
he was checking on the bodies.

54
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:26,780
He actually has three lives on his hands.

55
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,760
This is terrifying.

56
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:32,120
We should call the police right now.

57
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,080
The police have found that

58
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:39,080
the late richest man in Rongcheng,

59
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,720
He Shi, the eldest son of the He family,

60
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,400
was involved in three cases.

61
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,640
The police have confirmed that

62
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:44,480
the deceased are

63
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,720
Mrs. He, Zhang Xin,

64
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,080
the former butler of the He family,
Liu Dan,

65
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:49,940
and the director of an orphanage.

66
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:55,840
Mei,

67
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,850
all the storms have passed.

68
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:59,320
I believe the days ahead

69
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,240
will be beautiful

70
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:02,880
and peaceful.

71
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,720
Fortunately,

72
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,410
I'm not alone in the end.

73
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,400
You two,

74
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,930
stop being so lovey-dovey.

75
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,260
We're invited to a fashion gala tonight.

76
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,540
Let's go together.

77
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,360
Okay, sure.

78
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:29,360
Good evening,

79
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,800
Miss, Second Young Master,
and Eldest Young Mistress.
